      "title": "comiendo, viviendo — two families, one ending",
      "headword": "comiendo · viviendo",
      "romanization": "comiendo · viviendo",
      "gloss": "eating, living — the other two verb families, which stopped being two families the moment this form was built",
      "script": "latin",
